[B]Redis client:[/B] [ICODE]php-redis[/ICODE] is [B]not installed on any PHP version[/B]. SV/RedisCache uses its bundled pure-PHP [B]Credis[/B] client on 8.2–8.6. A separate control showed phpredis and Credis within 1–2 % of each other on this workload, so the PHP-version comparison is like for like.

[B]PHP profile:[/B] [ICODE]pm = static[/ICODE], 12 workers (Host A) / 16 workers (Host B), [ICODE]memory_limit=512M[/ICODE], OPcache 512 MB, interned strings 64 MB, [B]JIT tracing, 64 MB[/B], hot thresholds [ICODE]64/127/16/64[/ICODE]. JIT was confirmed active on every version.

[B]Rate limiting:[/B] all Angie [ICODE]limit_req[/ICODE] directives were disabled for the tests.


